Description: Raspberry Pi WiFi provisioning via BLE
 TelarWeb provides WiFi provisioning for headless Raspberry Pi devices
 via Bluetooth Low Energy (BLE). It includes a BLE GATT server for
 wireless configuration and a factory reset tool for recovery.
 .
 Components:
  - BLE WiFi provisioning server (ble_wifi_config.py)
  - Factory reset utility (pi-factory-reset)
  - Systemd service integration
 .
 For the web dashboard, install telarweb-pihole-companion.
 .
 Perfect for headless Raspberry Pi Zero 2 W setups where keyboard
 and monitor access is not available.

